	(text "MCU module (Rev A) - design notes\n\nEbyte E73-2G4M08S1C (nRF52840, ceramic antenna, 13 x 18 x 3.0 mm), DEC-017. Normal voltage mode:\nVCC = VDDH = 3V3 with 4.7 uF (C401); DCCH not connected. REG1 DC/DC inductors, 32 MHz crystal and DECx/DECUSB\ncapacitors are inside the module (Ebyte reference circuit, section 5.1).\nModule VBUS (pin 27) through 2.2 ohm (R401) with 4.7 uF (C402); the charger branch does not pass through R401.\nUSB D+/D- via 0 ohm links R402/R403 from the TPD4E05U06 (charger sheet).\nLFXO: CM7V-T1A 9 pF on XL1/XL2 (P0.00/P0.01) with external 12 pF C0G loads C405/C406 (nRF52840 has no\ninternal LFXO load; 12 pF = 2 x 9 pF less pin and board stray, calculated, to verify against the PS table).\nNFC1/NFC2 (P0.09/P0.10) carry IMU_INT1/IMU_INT2 as GPIO (CONFIG_NFCT_PINS_AS_GPIOS); both idle low.\nP0.18/RESET is nRESET (pin reset enabled in UICR by firmware). Low-frequency pins (Ebyte) carry only\nslow signals or analog inputs. All 29 GPIO are used; CHG_STAT has no MCU pin (OD-63).\nAntenna: keep the footprint keep-out (all layers) clear of copper, battery, magnets and screws.\nPin map: IMPLEMENTATION DECISION from the Ebyte pin table. Nothing measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
